1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,831
Speaking, task one. Topic 13: Food and cooking. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:12,662
What do you like to eat?

3
00:00:18,067 --> 00:00:20,878
I like pasta, chicken and vegetables.

4
00:00:21,767 --> 00:00:23,230
Who cooks at your home?

5
00:00:28,633 --> 00:00:31,614
Mostly I cook at home; at the weekend my wife cooks.

6
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:33,871
What do you usually cook?

7
00:00:39,267 --> 00:00:42,567
I usually cook soup, meat with potatoes or rice.

8
00:00:43,467 --> 00:00:45,048
What food don't you like?

9
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:52,855
I don't like fish because I don't like the taste.

10
00:00:53,767 --> 00:00:55,199
Where do you buy food?

11
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:03,381
I buy food at the supermarket and vegetables at the market.

12
00:01:04,267 --> 00:01:05,909
What Czech dish do you know?

13
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:15,765
I know svíčková, goulash and dumplings. I like svíčková.

14
00:01:16,667 --> 00:01:18,970
What is a typical dish in your country?

15
00:01:24,367 --> 00:01:27,861
In my country borscht is typical; it's a beetroot soup.

16
00:01:28,767 --> 00:01:30,420
What did you cook yesterday?

17
00:01:35,833 --> 00:01:38,171
Yesterday I cooked chicken with rice and a salad.

18
00:01:39,067 --> 00:01:40,623
What will you cook at the weekend?

19
00:01:46,033 --> 00:01:48,788
At the weekend I'll cook goulash because guests are coming.

20
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:51,868
What dish would you like to learn to cook?

21
00:01:57,267 --> 00:01:59,659
I'd like to learn to make Czech dumplings.

22
00:02:00,567 --> 00:02:11,068
Great! Practise topic 13 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
